  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okobokigwa kwa Yeso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 16:1-18; Luk 24:1-12; Yoh 20:1-10)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esabato egachia koera, kobogokiamoka rituko ria Jumapili, Mariamu Magadalena na oria Mariamu onde bakagenda korora oboina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na rora, norengeo omotengecho omonene, ekiagera omomalaika bw’Omonene aigete korwa igoro, agachia agatigeria rigena riria, akariikaransera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekieni kiaye nigo kiarenge buna okomesa kw’embura, na eyanga yaye nendabu buna amagena y’embura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase okomoiroka ere abarendi bakaiguswa, bakaba buna abanto bakuure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende omomalaika agateebia abakungu baria, “Timoiroka inwe, ekiagera namanyire ng’a Yeso mokorigia, oria obambetwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari aiga, ekiagera obokire, buna ateebete. Inchuo, morigererie aase Omonene araire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na genda bwango, moteebie aborokigwa baye ng’a obokire korwa ase abakuure; na rora, obatang’aneire kogenda Galili; agwo nao moramorore. Rora, inche nabatebirie ayio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaimoka korwa ase oboina bwango, bare nokoiroka na omogooko omonene, bakaminyoka, bakairera aborokigwa baye amang’ana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na rora, Yeso akaumerana na barabwo, akabakwania, “Omorembe obe nainwe!” Na barabwo bagaacha, bakamobwata amagoro, bakamosasiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeso akabateebia, “Timoiroka! Genda moteebie abaminto bagende Galili, nao barandore.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana y’abarendi boboina",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero abakungu baria bachire, rora abande b’abarendi baria boboina bagasoa ase omochie, bagateebia abakuani abanene amang’ana onsi ayakoregete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuani abanene bakaumerana amo n’abagaaka, bakaroisia omoroberio erio bakaa abarendi baria chitaabu chinyinge,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakaboora, “Moteebie abanto: Aborokigwa baye mbachete botuko, bakamoiba ekero twararire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana eri koriraigweke ase gabana, intwe natoche tokwane nere, tomoebererie, na kobarusia inwe ase emechando.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabogoria chitaabu chiria, bagakora buna bateebetigwe, na omogano oyo okumire ase Abayahudi goika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso okoorokera aborokigwa baye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aborokigwa baria ikomi nomo bakagenda Galili, bagaika egetunwa keria Yeso abachiigete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero bachia komorora, bakamosasiima; korende abande mbabete n’echitang’utang’u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso agacha ange nabarabwo akabateebia, “Naeirwe okobua gwonsi igoro na ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki genda mokore ebisaku bionsi koba aborokigwa, mokobaabatisa ase erieta ria Tata, neri’Omwana, neri’Omoika Omochenu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mokoborokereria kobwata aya onsi nabachiikire; na rora, inche nigo inde amo nainwe amatuko onsi goika omoerio bw’ense.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
